      "message": "that\u0027s not really explicit in that part of the code, \nbut current_dev_type is initialized with the value of tsu6721_get_device_type() which is the concatenation of 3 8-bit registers: \nint tsu6721_get_device_type(void)\n{\n        return (tsu6721_read(TSU6721_REG_DEV_TYPE3) \u003c\u003c 16) |\n               (tsu6721_read(TSU6721_REG_DEV_TYPE2) \u003c\u003c 8) |\n               (tsu6721_read(TSU6721_REG_DEV_TYPE1));\n}\n\nso in my opinion, this is relatively safe.",
